MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: it is my honor to present to you the proposed budget

113
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:12,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: of the Movie and Television Review and Classification Board

114
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:16,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: for Fiscal Year 2027.

115
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:20,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The total proposed budget

116
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:23,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: for Fiscal Year 2027 amounts to

117
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:28,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: $197,898,000.

118
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:33,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Of this, only $53.39 million

119
