MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The graph shows the proposed budget

125
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:57,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: for Fiscal Year 2027 by allotment case

126
00:13:57,480 --> 00:14:01,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: with a total of $197,898,000.

127
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:05,480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The personal services amounting to $53.39 million

128
