326
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:11,040
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: But I would like to reiterate that it is only the regulation that we can do.

327
00:32:11,040 --> 00:32:20,860
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: I'd like to clarify that the movies that will be exhibited in the online streaming platforms do not need to go through prior constraint,

328
