Senator Erwin Tulfo: parang bakit po umahabot sa 625 million

1370
01:48:01,360 --> 01:48:03,260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ang inyong total funding requirement

1371
01:48:03,260 --> 01:48:08,340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung 425 million lamang ang inyong original proposal, Ms. Rachel?

1372
01:48:08,760 --> 01:48:12,260
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Actually po, one is for the film restoration.

1373
01:48:13,540 --> 01:48:19,100
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: The team who's handling the restoration has submitted us their proposal

1374
01:48:19,100 --> 01:48:21,020
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: which is amounting to 50 million.

1375
01:48:21,300 --> 01:48:24,960
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Just recently, when they were able to identify,

1376
01:48:25,320 --> 01:48:25,960
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: the titles.

1377
01:48:26,460 --> 01:48:30,420
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And that was even before the budget call of the DBM

