PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Hindi lang namin kayo sususpindi ng 1 year,

2606
02:35:21,920 --> 02:35:24,040
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: but i-elevate namin yung kaso,

2607
02:35:24,040 --> 02:35:27,020
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: doon sa proper government authority.

2608
02:35:27,360 --> 02:35:31,620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nakikita niyo ba kung pinipigilan nung Jackie yung kanyang kabayo?

2609
02:35:31,800 --> 02:35:37,900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, instead of largahan niya, pipigilan niya kasi usong-uso dati ang gano'n.

2610
02:35:38,000 --> 02:35:41,940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sasabihin ng mga manunood, pinipigilan o pinipigilan nung Jackie yung kabayo?

2611
02:35:42,040 --> 02:35:44,460
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ngayon po, meron na po tayong introduced 3 years ago,

2612
02:35:45,080 --> 02:35:46,980
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: a drone shot, nasa taas po yung camera,

2613
02:35:47,500 --> 02:35:50,400
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: makikita po yung galaw ng siko, nung kabayo, nung hinete.

2614
02:35:50,900 --> 02:35:52,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, makikita. Kitang-kita po yun.

2615
02:35:52,440 --> 02:35:53,380
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Nagka-close up po yun.

2616
02:35:54,040 --> 02:35:57,580
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, yun po yung implement na isa sa mga ginawa namin, yung drone shot.

2617
02:35:58,260 --> 02:36:02,220
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, nahihira pa rin silang pumigit o magpasara o magpaliko na alanganin.

2618
02:36:02,720 --> 02:36:04,880
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Magnakitaan po yun, pinapatawag sila, motoprope po yun.

2619
02:36:06,040 --> 02:36:11,360
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Yung mga nasa media po, sad to say,

2620
02:36:11,480 --> 02:36:14,960
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: nag-meeting kami ng mga ibang organizations, ng mga betors,

2621
02:36:15,380 --> 02:36:16,200
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: ang sabi nila sa amin,

2622
02:36:16,280 --> 02:36:18,840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Chairman, karamihan dyan, natatalo na ng 20 pesos,

2623
02:36:18,960 --> 02:36:21,180
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: mas maingay pa sa amin na tumataya kami ng 1,000.

2624
02:36:21,180 --> 02:36:23,660
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: E, hindi po natin maiwasan kasi,

2625
02:36:24,040 --> 02:36:25,920
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: nasa democratic country po tayo.

2626
02:36:26,320 --> 02:36:27,880
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, pinapaliwanag nalang namin sa kanila.

2627
02:36:28,140 --> 02:36:29,520
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, nagiging transparent kami sa kanila.

2628
02:36:29,960 --> 02:36:32,580
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Yung state world report, pinapost namin sa aming social media.

2629
02:36:33,060 --> 02:36:36,620
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: At yung aming motoprope decision, binibigay din po namin sa kanila.

2630
02:36:37,980 --> 02:36:41,960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sir, may we know the actions taken by Phil Racom on COA's findings,

2631
02:36:42,160 --> 02:36:46,520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: particularly your underutilization po ng breakage fund.

2632
02:36:47,300 --> 02:36:49,480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nagagamit po ba talaga ito ng Phil Racom?

2633
02:36:49,580 --> 02:36:51,360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po itong breakage fund?

2634
02:36:51,360 --> 02:36:53,220
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Yung breakage fund po, actually,

2635
02:36:54,040 --> 02:36:56,400
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: nama po yung tanong ninyo, napakaganda po yung tanong ninyo.

2636
02:36:56,600 --> 02:36:59,240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Yung breakage fund po, dapat po yan sa STAD farm eh.

2637
02:36:59,440 --> 02:37:00,680
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Sa STAD farm allocation.

2638
02:37:00,880 --> 02:37:05,480
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ngayon, ah, yung dati po ang Philippine Racing Club doon po sa Santa Ana,

2639
02:37:05,680 --> 02:37:07,160
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: na nalipat po sa NAE,

2640
02:37:07,360 --> 02:37:10,360
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: ah, may utang pa po sa gobyerno yun, ha?

2641
02:37:10,560 --> 02:37:13,400
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Dapat yun. Hindi naman nila bibigyan sa Philippine Racing Commission po yun eh.

2642
02:37:13,600 --> 02:37:16,560
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Bibigyan nila kung sino yung may hawak ng STAD farm.

2643
02:37:16,760 --> 02:37:17,480
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, yun po yun.

2644
02:37:17,680 --> 02:37:21,960
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Nasa, pwede lang po yung STAD book, yung STAD farm nasa bayi po ngayon,

2645
02:37:22,160 --> 02:37:23,960
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: sa Department of Agriculture.

2646
02:37:24,200 --> 02:37:26,880
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Kung kukuha po ng gobyerno yan, malaking bagay po yan,

2647
02:37:27,080 --> 02:37:30,080
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: at may bibigyan doon sa, sa bayi,

2648
02:37:30,280 --> 02:37:33,360
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: or sa sino man namin may hawak ng STAD farm ngayon.

2649
02:37:33,560 --> 02:37:35,280
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Offensive Funding.

2650
02:37:35,480 --> 02:37:37,480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero yan, dyan sa may UP bandadi po ba?

2651
02:37:37,680 --> 02:37:40,760
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Opo, nalipat po sa, nalipat po sa LIPA.

2652
02:37:40,960 --> 02:37:43,680
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Hawak po ngayon ng, ano yan, ng, ah, bayi.

2653
02:37:43,880 --> 02:37:47,480
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Kaya lang nung nakaraang meeting, ah, the other day po, ando po ko sa Congress,

2654
02:37:47,680 --> 02:37:53,600
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: hinihiling din po namin, kasama doon sa, sa aming, ah, hiling na ilipat sa Philippine Racing Commission,

2655
02:37:54,040 --> 02:37:57,040
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: yung, ah, STAD farm operation.

2656
02:37:57,240 --> 02:38:01,240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Dahil meron po tayong binili na kabayo, dalawa pong important na kabayo,

2657
02:38:01,440 --> 02:38:04,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: nagkakaralaga po yan ng, ah, 8 million.

2658
02:38:04,640 --> 02:38:11,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: I think that was 2015 o 16, ah, nung si Sen. Villar po, Sen. Villar po ay nag-initiate yan.

2659
02:38:11,840 --> 02:38:15,840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ah, sad to say po, ah, nung binisita namin doon sa STAD farm,

2660
02:38:16,040 --> 02:38:22,000
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: na pa, na pangasiwa nung, ah, bayi, ay, ah, mukhang napabayaan po yung kabayo, eh.

2661
02:38:22,200 --> 02:38:24,000
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Hindi po nakakapag-produce ng maximum.

2662
02:38:24,240 --> 02:38:26,240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Earnings para sa gobyerno.

2663
02:38:26,440 --> 02:38:35,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, another question po, ah, yung prices po, who determines na ito, is it mat, mathematics?

2664
02:38:35,640 --> 02:38:37,640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is it computed by a machine?

2665
02:38:37,840 --> 02:38:39,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Computed by the people?

2666
02:38:40,040 --> 02:38:43,040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung magkano yung betors, magkano po yung mananalo?

2667
02:38:43,240 --> 02:38:53,040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, for example, sa, ah, ah, double-double, or sa ikang trifecta, pentafecta, ah,

2668
02:38:53,240 --> 02:38:57,240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: winner-take-all, who determines that, na ito yung premyo?

2669
02:38:57,440 --> 02:39:01,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Magamit po tayo ng, ano, magamit po tayo ng, ah, international totalisator, no?

2670
02:39:01,640 --> 02:39:08,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: International totalisator po, ginagamit ng Amerika, ginagamit ng Europe, at lahat ng, ah, bansa sa buong mundo, no?

2671
02:39:08,840 --> 02:39:14,840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ah, United Tote po ang pangalan, United Tote. So, yan po ay, ah, ah, hindi po pwedeng dayain.

2672
02:39:15,040 --> 02:39:20,840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, bawat taya, bawat taya ng mananaya, ay, ah, makikita automatic, ah, competition,

2673
02:39:20,840 --> 02:39:24,240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: kung magkano yung ibibigay sa double, sa porca, sa winner-take-all, dun po.

2674
02:39:24,440 --> 02:39:30,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Naka, ano po yan, nakaprogram po yan. So, wala po makikita dyan, kahit sinkundaya po, wala po makikita dyan.

2675
02:39:30,640 --> 02:39:40,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ah, internationally acceptable. Ah, ah, United Tote po, pwede nyo pong i-research, ah, United Tote, ah, totalisator, yun po yung taga-handler niyan.

2676
02:39:40,840 --> 02:39:48,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit po may mga games, minsan may, may race, kunwari race 3, parang tatlong kabayo, apat na kabayo, anong, kung ano doon?

2677
02:39:49,040 --> 02:39:50,740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At meron namang karera na, siyempre.

2678
02:39:50,840 --> 02:39:54,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano naman tatakbo? O walo? Pero meron ba, apat lang ang tatakbo?

2679
02:39:55,040 --> 02:40:02,040
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ah, sa 2-year-old na kabayo po, in the 2-year-old, kasi kukunti lang ang population yan, ah, pinapayagan po namin yung apat na kabayo.

2680
02:40:02,240 --> 02:40:09,240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Pero yung 4-year-old and above, o 3-year-old and above, maximum, minimum po is 6, 6, yun po yun.

2681
02:40:09,440 --> 02:40:14,840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Kasi sa pagkalimbawa, ah, this season of September, lumalabas na yung mga 2-year-old this year.

2682
02:40:15,040 --> 02:40:20,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, September to December, tumatakba yung mga 2-year-old. Pinapayagan po namin tumakba yung apat na kabayo.

2683
02:40:20,840 --> 02:40:30,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, pag na-scout yung isa, nagiging tatlo, pero tolerable naman po yun. Base po doon sa aming mandato. Base po doon.

2684
02:40:30,640 --> 02:40:39,640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung ating mga magagaling na jockeys, how true na napapirate po sa Saudi, ng mga hari, ng mga prinsipe?

2685
02:40:39,840 --> 02:40:48,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung mga magagaling natin, Ray, ang naiiwan, hindi na masyado kagalingan, or mga bagong pasok, mga rookie, pero yung mga magagaling, dahil napakalaki ng sweldo,

2686
02:40:49,040 --> 02:40:50,640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: napakalaki.

2687
02:40:50,840 --> 02:41:02,640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano nga, OFW po sila, may mga bakasyon. Anong ginagawa ng Philracom para, I mean, yung mga magagaling, sasakay pa rin naman dito at hindi na pupupunta sa abroad?

2688
02:41:02,840 --> 02:41:12,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Actually, yung mga hinete na Pilipino ngayon na nag-aabroad, hindi po sila hinete doon. Exercise rider lang po sila doon. Hindi po sila jockey.

2689
02:41:12,840 --> 02:41:18,640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Meron po yung jockey siguro mga in the last 5 or 10 years, siguro tatlo lang yung naging hinete doon.

2690
02:41:18,640 --> 02:41:26,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Jockey Bakaykay, jockey Zarate, jockey Abobo, no? Kunti lang po. Pero karamihan po sa kanila, exercise rider.

2691
02:41:26,640 --> 02:41:36,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Pero yun po, since for the last 5 years, tumaas ng tumaas ang, ang ano, ang premium rito because sa power assistance, no?

2692
02:41:36,640 --> 02:41:45,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Napagbigitan bumalik dito yung mga dating hinete yung naging exercise rider doon, dahil nakita nila, mas malaki pa yung kikitain nila dito compared sa abroad.

2693
02:41:45,640 --> 02:41:48,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Napakalaki ng tax doon sa abroad.

2694
02:41:48,640 --> 02:41:54,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Compared dito. So, bumabalik po. Marami na po bumabalik dito ng mga magaling hinete po.

2695
02:41:54,640 --> 02:41:57,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Saan? Siyempre, iba rin po yung kasama nila, yung pamilya nila dito.

2696
02:41:57,640 --> 02:41:59,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Definitely po.

2697
02:41:59,640 --> 02:42:03,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Well, sir, there being, I have no more other questions.

2698
02:42:03,640 --> 02:42:11,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: The fiscal year 2027 proposed budget of the Philippine Racing Commission is now being submitted for plenary consideration.

2699
02:42:11,640 --> 02:42:16,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Subject of the discussion, submission of requested documents.

2700
02:42:16,640 --> 02:42:18,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Therefore, I would like to

2701
02:42:18,640 --> 02:42:29,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: thank you and the other agencies before you, MTRCB, OMB, FTCP, and their whole delegations for their budget briefing to this committee.

2702
02:42:29,640 --> 02:42:33,440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: This budget briefing is hereby suspended. Maraming salamat po.

2703
02:42:33,640 --> 02:42:35,440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

